{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29634","headline":"七月二十九日崇让宅讌作 · 李商隐","name":"七月二十九日崇让宅讌作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露如微霰下前池，月过回塘万竹悲。\n浮世本来多聚散，红蕖何事亦离披。\n悠扬归梦惟灯见，濩落生涯独酒知。\n岂到白头长只尔，嵩阳松雪有心期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29634.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29634","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}